# Training runs: only the Path B detector is tracked (weights, ONNX files, sidecars, training args)
runs/*
!runs/yolo26s_athlete_ball/
runs/yolo26s_athlete_ball/*
!runs/yolo26s_athlete_ball/best.pt
!runs/yolo26s_athlete_ball/*.onnx
!runs/yolo26s_athlete_ball/*.onnx.json
!runs/yolo26s_athlete_ball/args.yaml
# Temporal ball specialist c5c (docs/architecture/BALL_TEMPORAL_ARCH.md): weights, ONNX + sidecar,
# training args and curves. last.pt (optimiser state, 174 MB) stays out, as do the other runs.
!runs/ball_temporal/
runs/ball_temporal/*
!runs/ball_temporal/c5c/
runs/ball_temporal/c5c/*
!runs/ball_temporal/c5c/best.pt
!runs/ball_temporal/c5c/ball_specialist_c5c.onnx
!runs/ball_temporal/c5c/ball_specialist_c5c.onnx.json
!runs/ball_temporal/c5c/args.json
!runs/ball_temporal/c5c/history.csv
!runs/ball_temporal/c5c/curves.png
*.weights

